A pending response may be completed and cleared before the response
data is loaded into part_buf. This causes the pending response to
be lost, so the host cannot retrieve it.

Add a flag to track whether the response data has been loaded into
part_buf. Do not process or complete the pending response until the
response data has been loaded.

